   "type": "text",
   "text": "Team: Analytiflow (ANA)   ·   one Linear PROJECT per engagement\nProject: GGCE IT Consultant Engagement\n  ├ ◆ Milestones  =  the 6 project PHASES (P1 … P6)\n  ├ ▸ Issues      =  contractual deliverables D1–D8   (status reconciled live)\n  │     └ sub-issues break down the ACTIVE phase (P4.1 … P4.9)\n  └ every issue ends:  “Source of record: scrum/product-backlog.md”\nNO Cycles · NO sprint-by-sprint replica  —  sprint history lives in the vault only.",
   "fontSize": 12.5,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "baseline": 12,
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Team: Analytiflow (ANA)   ·   one Linear PROJECT per engagement\nProject: GGCE IT Consultant Engagement\n  ├ ◆ Milestones  =  the 6 project PHASES (P1 … P6)\n  ├ ▸ Issues      =  contractual deliverables D1–D8   (status reconciled live)\n  │     └ sub-issues break down the ACTIVE phase (P4.1 … P4.9)\n  └ every issue ends:  “Source of record: scrum/product-backlog.md”\nNO Cycles · NO sprint-by-sprint replica  —  sprint history lives in the vault only.",
